prathamamakṣaraṃ dṛśyate(,) tatkoṣṭhāt mantrasyādyakṣarāvadhi(,) yasmin koṣṭhe 
mantraghaṭakākṣarāṇāṃ prathamamakṣaraṃ dṛśyate tatkoṣṭhaṃ yāvad yenaiva likhanaṃ 
