(dīkṣāyāṃ tithiniyamaḥ)

caturthī navamī caiva caturdaśyaṣṭamīi tathā |
pūrṇimā pañcamī caiva dvitīyā saptamī tathā || 138 ||

trayodaśī ca daśamī praśastā sarvasiddhidā |

