ityanena pūrvāṣāḍhāyāḥ prāśastye'pi (-)

	pratipadi kṛtā dīkṣā duḥkhāya maraṇāya ca |

iti tantrasāradhṛtavacane pratipado'niṣṭaphalakatvāt tatsaṃyoge praśastāyā api pūrvāṣāḍhāyā 
duṣṭatvam | evaṃ pañcamyāḥ prāśastye'pi apraśastāyāḥ kṛttikāyāḥ saṃyogāttasyā 
aprāśatyam | yatrobhayorapi tithinakṣatrayoḥ prāśastyaṃ tatrāpi prāguktarītyā tayoḥ 
saṃyogo'niṣṭaṃ phalaṃ prasūte (-) yathā daśamīrohiṇyoḥ svataḥ prāśastye'pi parasparasaṃyoge 
tayorubhayorevāniṣṭaphalānubandhitvam | evamanyatrāpi |


(prāguktamāsādiśuddhermantradīkṣāmātraparatvam)

yanmāsatithivārādi(-)śodhanaṃ proktameva hi |
