(atra prāmāṇikāgamanirṇayaḥ)

yoginīhṛdayasyeti matamālakṣya kīrtitam || 155 ||

(mantrapadavyutpattiḥ)

mananāttrāṇanāccaivamadvayasyāvabodhanāt |
