triguṇīkṛtasūtreṇa śubhānyāveṣṭayet tridhā || 47 ||

prakṣālya deśikasteṣu padeṣvāhitaśāliṣu |
sagandhadarbhakūrceṣu paścimādi niveśayet || 48 ||

